<title>USA: Subaru October US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Subaru October US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Subaru **</p>
<p>			Oct 1-31, 1996     Oct 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     9,451	     7,590	    +19.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		 2,515	     2,071	    +16.9</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Oct 31, 1996 Jan 1-Oct 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    76,641	    57,407	    +32.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck		 0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p> Import Car		20,820	    22,490	     -8.1</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 27 in latest month vs 26, 258 for year to date vs 256 in year ago.</p>
<p>** Unit of Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd.</p>
</text>
